spec hz02-autocommit-read-releases-slot-lpg: 2 sessions, 15 permutations
# HZ02 through the lpg API: s1 pins Graph.BeginRead and releases it; s2 reads x.v at
# a snapshot taken and released for that one read. Only a held snapshot occupies a
# slot.

